<title>FRANCE: Valeo H1 net attrib profit 656 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Valeo H1 net attrib profit 656 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     656  vs	     629</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)    9.5  vs	     9.1</p>
<p>    Operating				    1,020  vs	     834</p>
<p>    Turnover				    15,060  vs	  13,020</p>
<p>    Shareholders funds			10,758  vs	   9,607</p>
<p>NOTE - French car parts maker Valeo said in a statement that excluding exceptional capital gains of 130 million francs made in the year ago period, the net result was up 31 percent despite a higher tax bill.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 cct/pnt</p>
